  "metadata": {
    "title": "Arkhe e Catedral: Documentação Explicativa em Duas Camadas do Ecossistema de Infraestrutura Verificável para Agentes de IA",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22741927",
    "publication_date": "2026-09-14",
    "description": "<p>Documentation for autonomous AI agent infrastructure tends to bifurcate into two equally<br>unhelpful extremes: technical jargon, inaccessible to managers, regulators and citizens, and<br>generic popularization, which strips away the precision that would make the material<br>usable by engineers. This paper presents an application of two-layer explanatory<br>documentation &mdash; lay and technical &mdash; to the Arkhe&ndash;Cathedral ecosystem, a verifiable<br>infrastructure project for AI agents (a containment kernel, decentralized identity,<br>cryptographic provenance and invariant-based governance) recorded in an internal corpus<br>of roughly twenty successive definitions. The method combines the explanation quadrant<br>of the Di&aacute;taxis framework, the plain-language principles of ISO 24495-1, and progressive<br>disclosure, while preserving the project's own epistemic discipline: no claim without a&nbsp;<br>verifiable origin, with an explicit distinction between stipulation and discovery. As a result,<br>the nine auditability contracts (Z1&ndash;Z9), the foundational concepts (zero-token architecture,<br>burn-after-use sessions, crypto-erasure) and the structuring metaphor of the Cathedral &mdash;<br>the criterion whereby each revision must leave the system more auditable than it found it<br>&mdash; become legible to both audiences without cross-layer contradiction. Limitations are<br>discussed: the corpus's naming fragmentation, the gap between specification and<br>implementation recorded by the project itself (the form-without-function diagnosis), and<br>the residual risk that analogies create apparent understanding. The paper concludes that the<br>project's evidence discipline is itself the most valuable content of the documentation &mdash; and<br>that documenting it in two layers is what allows non-specialists to join in demanding<br>falsifiers.</p>",
